<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT-Art Vivant rated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Art Vivant rated.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura Research Institute Ltd has assigned Art Vivant Co Ltd a &quot;1&quot; rating, market sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute assigns a &quot;1&quot; rating to issues whose values it expects will outperform the key 225-share Nikkei average by more than 10 percentage points over the following six months.</p>
<p>Nomura officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
